# Claude device-local memory + fleet-link inbox (see ~/SPARC/CLAUDE.md → "Claude memory & SPARC Fleet Link")
Claude/working-memory/
Claude/sparc-fleet-link/inbox.md
# Plan/spec payloads delivered ALONGSIDE a fleet-link message. Device-local for the
# same reason inbox.md is: they are snapshots of a living document that lives on
# another device, and a TRACKED second copy is one that drifts silently on every
# clone. (readme.md stays tracked so the folder exists on every clone.)
Claude/sparc-fleet-link/*.plan.md
